From: lazy-jubei
Subject: [PATCH] winemac: run synchronous main-thread callbacks inline on the main thread

OpenGL redraw callbacks can call OnMainThread from the Cocoa main thread.
Queueing the block and waiting there prevents the same run loop from servicing
it, hanging the entire UI. Execute it inline when already on the main thread;
preserve the existing event-queue and semaphore paths for worker threads.

--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_event.m
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/cocoa_event.m
@@ -493,3 +493,10 @@
     WineEventQueue* queue = threadDict[WineEventQueueThreadDictionaryKey];
     dispatch_semaphore_t semaphore = NULL;
     __block BOOL finished;
+
+    /* Cocoa callbacks can reach this helper while already on the main thread. */
+    if ([NSThread isMainThread])
+    {
+        block();
+        return;
+    }
